SUMMARY:🧪 Lab | Azure AI Gateway: API Management for Intelligent Service
 s
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on lab\, use Azure API Management to expose\, man
 age\, and optimize AI services\, including large language models and Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) servers. Practice load balancing\, model routing\,
  token monitoring and rate limiting\, secure MCP tools\, semantic caching\
 , and content safety to build scalable\, secure\, and cost-effective AI-po
 wered solutions.\n\nTopics:\n- Load balance across Azure OpenAI resources 
 and route requests to specific models\n- Configure session affinity for co
 nsistent interactions\n- Monitor token usage and apply rate limits to cont
 rol consumption\n- Optimize AI service costs and performance\n- Expose MCP
  servers through API Management and publish REST APIs as MCP tools\n- Secu
 re MCP endpoints with authorization\n- Configure semantic caching to reduc
 e latency and token usage\n- Configure content safety filters and enforce 
 safety rules in API Management\n\nAudience: Technical teams interested in 
 managing and securing LLM services and MCP tools with Azure API Management
 .\n\nRegistration is required and subject to approval.\n\nThis series cale
 ndar is for discovery\, not registration. Entries are marked Free. Registe
 r separately for the sessions you want to attend.\n\nRegistration closes M
 onday\, November 30\, 2026 at 9:00 AM ET.\n\nRegister: https://ms-workshop
 s.cloudevents.ai/ms-innovation-workshops/events/67e59ab7-ed5b-4816-a3ce-1f
 918ea3fa3d
