SUMMARY:🧪 Lab | GitHub Copilot Innovation Workshop - Mastering GitHub Co
 pilot Across the SDLC
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:Gain hands-on experience using GitHub Copilot throughout the so
 ftware development life cycle\, from feature planning and prototyping to i
 mplementation\, code review\, and remediation. Practice AI-assisted develo
 pment to improve productivity\, code quality\, and security\, and extend C
 opilot with MCP and custom prompts. Register individually\; registrations 
 are initially waitlisted and access is confirmed after approval.\n\nTopics
 :\n- Apply GitHub Copilot through all SDLC stages\n- Plan and build featur
 es with AI-assisted tools\n- Speed up coding\, reviews\, and fixes with au
 tomation\n- Extend and optimize Copilot using MCP and custom prompts\n\nAu
 dience: Developers who want practical experience using GitHub Copilot for 
 feature planning\, implementation\, review\, and remediation in an interac
 tive team environment.\n\nRegistration is required and subject to approval
 .\n\nThis series calendar is for discovery\, not registration. Entries are
  marked Free. Register separately for the sessions you want to attend.\n\n
 Registration closes Wednesday\, December 2\, 2026 at 9:00 AM ET.\n\nRegist
 er: https://ms-workshops.cloudevents.ai/ms-innovation-workshops/events/B83
 FD2ED-B90E-4230-BF6A-2CA34594377E
