SUMMARY:🧪 Lab | AI-Assisted Development with GitHub Copilot
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on lab\, use GitHub Copilot to accelerate generat
 ive AI app development. Explore Copilot's core features\, scaffold and ref
 actor a summarizer web app\, integrate Azure OpenAI\, and automate deploym
 ent to Azure using GitHub Actions. Practice contextual prompts\, improve a
 pplication UI and real-time features\, and streamline issues and pull requ
 ests with GitHub Copilot Agent.\n\nTopics:\n- Use GitHub Copilot in VS Cod
 e for AI-assisted app development\n- Build\, refactor\, and test an Azure 
 OpenAI web app\n- Automate deployment with GitHub Actions and secrets\n- E
 nhance apps with prompts\, features\, and collaboration through Copilot Ag
 ent\n\nAudience: Developers interested in hands-on AI-assisted application
  development with GitHub Copilot in VS Code\, Azure OpenAI\, and GitHub Ac
 tions.\n\nRegistration is required and subject to approval.\n\nThis series
  calendar is for discovery\, not registration. Entries are marked Free. Re
 gister separately for the sessions you want to attend.\n\nRegistration clo
 ses Tuesday\, December 8\, 2026 at 1:00 PM ET.\n\nRegister: https://ms-wor
 kshops.cloudevents.ai/ms-innovation-workshops/events/0f992fbc-7567-4106-98
 d2-c0529baa1d20
