SUMMARY:💡 Briefing | From Universe to Action: GitHub Universe 2026 Recap
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:Catch up on highlights from GitHub Universe 2026 in this one-ho
 ur virtual briefing. Explore what is next in AI-powered software developme
 nt and what the announcements mean for engineering organizations and devel
 opers. Discuss tooling\, security\, and governance as AI changes how softw
 are is built. Register individually\; registrations are initially waitlist
 ed and access is confirmed after approval.\n\nTopics:\n- Highlights and an
 nouncements from GitHub Universe 2026\n- What is next in AI-powered softwa
 re development\n- Implications for engineering organizations and developer
 s\n- Tooling\, security\, and governance as AI changes software developmen
 t\n\nAudience: Engineering leaders\, platform and security strategists\, a
 nd developers interested in the latest GitHub announcements and their impl
 ications for software development.\n\nRegistration is required and subject
  to approval.\n\nThis series calendar is for discovery\, not registration.
  Entries are marked Free. Register separately for the sessions you want to
  attend.\n\nRegister: https://ms-workshops.cloudevents.ai/ms-innovation-wo
 rkshops/events/1DC26A3E-6B77-4FE1-A1A0-516802753DED
